  "description": "The Flightline Two 29 features Haro's X6 series alloy frame with internal cable routing, mounted with a Suntour XCE-28 fork. A 24-speed drive train provides versatility in a variety of terrain with mechanical disc brakes for maximum stopping power in all-weather conditions. Alloy double-wall rims for strength, laced with rust-free stainless steel spokes onto 32-hole alloy hubs fitted with 29\" x 2.2\" multi-surface tires that roll fast and smooth over all terrains. Go anywhere!\nFL Two X6 Series frame w/ post mount\nSuntour XCE-28 fork w/ 100mm travel, post mount\nAluminum 42/34/24T crankset\nShimano Tourney TX-800 rear derailleur\nShimano ST-EF500 3x8-spd shifters\nShimano HG200 8-spd 12-32T cassette\nMX-21 29\" Aluminum rims, 27mm wide\nJak-7 mechanical disc brakeset w/ 160mm rotors",
